#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:6
msgid "# Versioning and Release"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:11
msgid ""
"FreeAnima follows [Semantic Versioning 2.0.0](https://semver.org/) "
"(`MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH`).  The **sole write source** is `\"version\"` in the "
"root [`package.json`](../../package.json); other workspace sub-package "
"`package.json` files **do not** include a `version` field.  Runtime reads "
"the root version via `ANIMA_VERSION` from `@freeanima/service`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:13
msgid ""
"Release is handled by **[Release Please](https://github.com/googleapis/"
"release-please)** in GitHub Actions (see [`.github/workflows/release.yml`]"
"(../../.github/workflows/release.yml))."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:15
msgid "## When to Bump Which Digit"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:17
msgid ""
"Determined by **Conventional Commits**. Currently in **0.x.y initial "
"development**, using 0.x convention: **x = breaking change, y = compatible "
"feature/fix** (differs from post-1.0.0 MAJOR/MINOR/PATCH semantics)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Commit                                             | Version digit  | Example           |\n"
"| -------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| `feat:`                                            | **PATCH (y)**  | `0.1.0` → `0.1.1` |\n"
"| `fix:` / `perf:` / `revert:`                       | **PATCH (y)**  | `0.1.1` → `0.1.2` |\n"
"| `BREAKING CHANGE:` or `feat!:`                     | **MINOR (x)**  | `0.1.2` → `0.2.0` |\n"
"| `chore:` / `docs:` / `refactor:` / `test:` / `ci:` | **No release** | —                 |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "**1.0.0** is not auto-published on breaking commits; maintainers decide explicitly when API is stable (commit footer `Release-As: 1.0.0` or dedicated release).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:28
msgid ""
"Multiple commits in one Release PR merge into **one release**, taking "
"highest bump (e.g. `fix` + `feat` → patch; `feat` + breaking → minor)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:30
msgid ""
"Release Please defaults to `feat` / `fix` / `deps` as releasable commit "
"triggers for Release PR updates; `perf` / `revert` appear in changelog but "
"alone may not open a Release PR (use `fix:` prefix or `Release-As` footer)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:32
msgid "## Checking Version Day-to-Day"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"bun -p \"require('./package.json').version\"\n"
"# Or after build:\n"
"bun run anima -- service status   # reads version from status file / health API\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:40
msgid "## Release Flow (Release PR)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:47
msgid "Write **Conventional Commits** on feature branches (see below)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:47
msgid "Merge PR to `main` (must pass `Quality` + `freeanima/blackbox`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:47
msgid ""
"`Release` workflow runs **release-please**: opens or updates a **Release "
"PR** (label `autorelease: pending`), accumulating changelog and version bump "
"since last tag"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:47
msgid ""
"Release PR runs full CI; **maintainers decide when to release**, merge "
"Release PR"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:47
msgid ""
"After merge, same workflow: `release_created` → tag `vX.Y.Z`, create GitHub "
"Release → `build:cli` + `publish-cli.sh` (npm OIDC)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:47
msgid ""
"Push `v*` tag triggers [`.github/workflows/release-docker.yml`]"
"(../../.github/workflows/release-docker.yml)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Not** one release per `feat`; **one release when Release PR merges** (accumulating multiple commits).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:51
msgid "### Commit Message Format"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:54
msgid "``` <type>(<scope>): <subject>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:56
msgid "[optional body]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:59
msgid "[optional footer: BREAKING CHANGE: ...] ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:61
msgid ""
"Common types: `feat`, `fix`, `perf`, `docs`, `chore`, `refactor`, `test`, "
"`ci`, `build`, `revert`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:63
msgid ""
"Local **`git commit` is enforced** (Husky `commit-msg` + [commitlint]"
"(https://commitlint.js.org/), config at root `commitlint.config.mjs`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:65
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:70
msgid ""
"``` feat(gateway): Discord thread continuation reuses session fix(cron): run "
"endpoint changed to async enqueue feat(api)!: remove non-SSE message endpoint"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:73
msgid "BREAKING CHANGE: POST /api/sessions/:id/messages removed ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:75
msgid "### Preview Next Version"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:77
msgid ""
"On GitHub, inspect **Release PR** diff (`package.json` + `CHANGELOG.md`) for "
"next version content and number."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:79
msgid ""
"Specify version in commit body with `Release-As: x.y.z` (see [Release Please "
"docs](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please))."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:81
msgid "### Version Manifest"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:83
msgid ""
"[`.release-please-manifest.json`](../../.release-please-manifest.json) "
"records current published version; must match latest `v*` tag and root "
"`package.json`; auto-updated by Release Please after release."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:85
msgid "## Bun Global Package and Docker Image"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:87
msgid "After Release PR merge and `release_created`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:91
msgid ""
"**`bun run build:cli`** — produces `cli/publish/` (`@freeanima/cli` tarball "
"contents)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:91
