#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:91
msgid ""
"**Docker image** — on `v*` tag push, [`.github/workflows/release-docker.yml`]"
"(../../.github/workflows/release-docker.yml) builds and pushes to `ghcr.io/"
"freeanima-org/freeanima:latest` and `:vX.Y.Z`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:93
msgid "### npm Trusted Publishing (Sole CI Publish Path)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:95
msgid ""
"Configure GitHub Actions in [npm Trusted Publishers](https://docs.npmjs.com/"
"trusted-publishers#for-github-actions) for `@freeanima/cli`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:102
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field                | Value           |\n"
"| -------------------- | --------------- |\n"
"| Organization or user | `freeanima-org` |\n"
"| Repository           | `freeanima`     |\n"
"| Workflow filename    | `release.yml`   |\n"
"| Allowed actions      | `npm publish`   |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:104
msgid ""
"Release workflow `publish` job has `id-token: write`; publish with `bunx "
"npm@11 publish` (do not use `setup-node` `registry-url`, blocks OIDC). `cli/"
"publish/package.json` `publishConfig.registry` must be `https://"
"registry.npmjs.org/` (trailing slash)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:106
msgid ""
"After verification, package Settings → Publishing access can **disallow "
"tokens**, OIDC-only publish."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:108
msgid "Local install of published package (dev debugging):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:114
msgid ""
"```bash bun run build:cli bun install -g ./cli/publish anima service start --"
"foreground ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:116
