"docker compose up --build\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:123
msgid "## Prohibited"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:127
msgid ""
"Do not hardcode `X.Y.Z` in business code; use `import { ANIMA_VERSION } from "
"\"@freeanima/service\"` (or expose via health/status)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:127
msgid "Do not maintain `version` in workspace sub-package `package.json`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:127
msgid ""
"Do not manually edit `CHANGELOG.md` or `[Unreleased]`; release notes come "
"from commits and Release Please."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:129
msgid "## Related Files"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/versioning.md:139
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| File                                     | Role                                              |\n"
"| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `package.json`                           | Sole version write source (updated by Release PR) |\n"
"| `release-please-config.json`             | Release Please strategy and changelog sections    |\n"
"| `.release-please-manifest.json`          | Published version manifest                        |\n"
"| `.github/workflows/release.yml`          | release-please + npm publish                      |\n"
"| `.github/workflows/release-docker.yml`   | Docker image push to GHCR                         |\n"
"| `service/service/src/runtime/version.ts` | Runtime root version read                         |\n"
"| `CHANGELOG.md`                           | New version section appended on Release PR merge  |\n"
msgstr ""

